{%- comment -%}
  The Mushroom Stack — the three functional mushrooms and why they work
  together. Reusable across homepage, collection, and product pages so the
  "stack + synergy" story is consistent everywhere. Doses are factual
  (900/700/400 = 2,000mg); copy stays lifestyle/traditional-use only.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="mstack">
  <div class="mstack-inner">
    <div class="mstack-head">
      <span class="mstack-eyebrow">The Stack</span>
      <h2 class="mstack-title">Three mushrooms, dosed to work together</h2>
      <p class="mstack-sub">One can layers Lion&rsquo;s Mane, Cordyceps and Reishi at 900&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;700&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;400mg &mdash; 2,000mg total &mdash; each one balancing the next: clear focus, a natural lift, and a steady finish.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mstack-grid">
      <!-- Visual dose stack -->
      <div class="mstack-chart">
        <div class="mstack-row">
          <div class="mstack-label"><span class="mstack-name">Lion&rsquo;s Mane</span><span class="mstack-role">Focus</span></div>
          <div class="mstack-track"><span class="mstack-bar mstack-bar-lion" style="width:100%"><em>900mg</em></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mstack-row">
          <div class="mstack-label"><span class="mstack-name">Cordyceps</span><span class="mstack-role">Lift</span></div>
          <div class="mstack-track"><span class="mstack-bar mstack-bar-cord" style="width:78%"><em>700mg</em></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mstack-row">
          <div class="mstack-label"><span class="mstack-name">Red Reishi</span><span class="mstack-role">Steady</span></div>
          <div class="mstack-track"><span class="mstack-bar mstack-bar-rei" style="width:44%"><em>400mg</em></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mstack-total"><span>Full blend</span><strong>2,000mg per can</strong></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Why they work together -->
      <ul class="mstack-why">
        <li>
          <span class="mstack-dot mstack-dot-lion" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <p><strong>Lion&rsquo;s Mane brings the focus.</strong> The clarity mushroom, dual-extracted from 100% fruiting bodies &mdash; the base of the stack.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="mstack-dot mstack-dot-cord" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <p><strong>Cordyceps adds a natural lift.</strong> An athlete&rsquo;s favorite that supports your body&rsquo;s own energy &mdash; caffeine-free, so it builds instead of spiking.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="mstack-dot mstack-dot-rei" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <p><strong>Reishi keeps it smooth.</strong> Richest of the three in triterpenes &mdash; it rounds off the lift so you feel even, never wired.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="mstack-cta-row">
          <a href="/pages/the-science" class="mstack-cta">See the science of the stack
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p class="mstack-disclaimer">&dagger; These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mstack { padding: 40px 20px; }
  /* Highlighted feature panel: soft 3-mushroom mesh + animated iridescent border */
  .mstack-inner {
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 52px 48px 40px;
    border: 2px solid transparent; border-radius: 34px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(58% 82% at 10% 6%,  rgba(82,183,136,0.22) 0%, rgba(82,183,136,0) 60%) padding-box,
      radial-gradient(54% 80% at 92% 4%,  rgba(245,166,35,0.20) 0%, rgba(245,166,35,0) 60%) padding-box,
      radial-gradient(70% 95% at 50% 112%, rgba(98,96,174,0.22) 0%, rgba(98,96,174,0) 62%) padding-box,
      linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FAFDFB 100%) padding-box,
      linear-gradient(120deg, #52B788, #2D9E6B, #F5A623, #FF9E4D, #7C78D6, #6260AE, #52B788) border-box;
    background-size: auto, auto, auto, auto, 320% 100%;
    background-position: 0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0% 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(45,106,79,0.16), 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    animation: mstackBorder 9s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes mstackBorder {
    0%   { background-position: 0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0% 50%; }
    100% { background-position: 0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 320% 50%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .mstack-inner { animation: none; } }
  .mstack-head { text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 40px; position: relative; }
  .mstack-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block; padding: 6px 15px; border-radius: 50px;
    background: rgba(45,106,79,0.10); color: var(--green-dark, #2D6A4F);
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .mstack-title { font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 38px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--ink, #16181B); margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .mstack-sub { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--gray, #55605A); margin: 0; }

  .mstack-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }

  /* Dose stack card — frosted glass so the mesh glows through */
  .mstack-chart {
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.66);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px) saturate(1.1);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px) saturate(1.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    border-radius: 22px; padding: 26px 26px 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(45,106,79,0.14), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
  }
  .mstack-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .mstack-label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.15; }
  .mstack-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink, #16181B); }
  .mstack-role { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gray, #7A857E); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .mstack-track { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius: 50px; height: 34px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
  .mstack-bar {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end;
    height: 100%; border-radius: 50px; padding: 0 14px; min-width: 62px;
    color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; white-space: nowrap;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35), 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    animation: mstackGrow 1s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) both;
  }
  .mstack-bar em { font-style: normal; }
  .mstack-bar-lion { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #5FC494, #2D9E6B); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35), 0 6px 16px rgba(45,158,107,0.35); }
  .mstack-bar-cord { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #FBB43C, #E08A00); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35), 0 6px 16px rgba(224,138,0,0.32); }
  .mstack-bar-rei  { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8985E0, #6260AE); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35), 0 6px 16px rgba(98,96,174,0.35); }
  @keyframes mstackGrow { from { transform: scaleX(0.02); transform-origin: left; } to { transform: scaleX(1); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .mstack-bar { animation: none; } }
  .mstack-total {
    display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px dashed rgba(45,106,79,0.25);
  }
  .mstack-total span { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gray, #7A857E); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .mstack-total strong { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--green-dark, #2D6A4F); }

  /* Why together */
  .mstack-why { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .mstack-why li { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .mstack-dot { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 5px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
  .mstack-dot-lion { background: #52B788; }
  .mstack-dot-cord { background: #F5A623; }
  .mstack-dot-rei  { background: #6260AE; }
  .mstack-why p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--gray, #55605A); }
  .mstack-why p strong { color: var(--ink, #16181B); font-weight: 800; }
  .mstack-cta-row { margin-top: 4px; }
  .mstack-cta {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--green-dark, #2D6A4F);
    text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor; padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: gap 0.2s ease;
  }
  .mstack-cta:hover { gap: 11px; }

  .mstack-disclaimer { text-align: center; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--gray, #98A19B); margin: 34px auto 0; max-width: 640px; line-height: 1.5; }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .mstack { padding: 48px 18px; }
    .mstack-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; }
    .mstack-row { grid-template-columns: 104px 1fr; gap: 10px; }
    .mstack-name { font-size: 14px; }
  }
</style>
